  "description": "A 10 x 10 city at 200 under a sea at 250 (50 m deep). IsNavigable fails when the square leaves the city, on another lot, on a power pole, on a bridge whose deck clears the water surface by less than 20 m or is unknown; a deck at 270 (exactly 20 m) passes and accepts the square at once (quirk 8: the pole at (2, 5) further out and the cells outside the city are not checked). Bodies of water: two pools of navigable cells, scanned x outer, z inner, get their IDs in scan order.",
